self-reference-bhartrhari-and-lawvere-pull-1794997158-18 = unlines (cons "Claude's construction, at Avik's request (2026-11-18): the two exits from the paradox of self-reference" (cons "differ. Set theory forbids the self-reference (the axiom of regularity). Bhartṛhari (5th century) keeps it" (cons "and indexes it to its occurrence: meaning is relative to the act of signifying and its moment. That is the" (cons "receive relation of Part I of hyperactivity (meaning depends on the receiver's state), and it is homotopy" (cons "type theory's way, which keeps self-application and makes truth a construction in context, not set" (cons "theory's prohibition." nil))))))
